{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019vFyexFx4kzqTe4eMzYvgh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0165Sr5dJuUcYqG8mWcceUJN","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"provenance_weight_training","file":"literature_map.yaml","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1446,"cache_read_input_tokens":15309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1446,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9ZUppDSzV44rVjzo6CkqD","session_id":"4e76514d-f28c-4641-af3a-08051cc17412","uuid":"7bc4f742-3d7e-4a5e-a373-d3cc2818f86d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0165Sr5dJuUcYqG8mWcceUJN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_10/projects/provenance_weight_training/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Literature Map for provenance_weight_training\\\\n# 研究方向：基于收敛理论的自适应污染重加权\\\\n# 核心公式：w=(1-q)^b，q 为检测器合成概率，b* 为理论最优权重指数\\\\n# 更新日期：2026-05-15（文献扫描：补充 Wang et al. + 4 方向新文献 + 修正 2 处错误）\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# Category: direct-competitor\\\\n# 同主题/同方法的论文\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- id: drayson_2025_detection_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Machine-Generated Text Detection Prevents Language Model Collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"George Drayson, Emine Yilmaz, Vasileios Lampos\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2502.15654\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.15654\\\\\\\"\\\\n  github: \\\\\\\"https://github.com/GeorgeDrayson/model_collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"使用同一公式 w=(1-q)^b 进行重加权，但 b 为验证集 empirical 选取，训练中固定\\\\\\\"\\\\n  method_summary: >\\\\n    Detect-and-reweight 防止递归训练 model collapse。检测器为 ModernBERT 150M\\\\n    (MAGE fine-tune, in-domain AUC=0.986, OOD AUC=0.943)。权重公式 wⱼ=(1-q(xⱼ))^b / Σₗ(1-q(xₗ))^b，\\\\n    通过 SIR 按权重重采样训练数据。b 通过 WikiText-2 验证集上 1 代递归训练后评估选取\\\\n    (GPT-2/SmolLM 135M/360M 用 b=10, SmolLM 1.7B 用 b=1)，训练全程固定。\\\\n    实验覆盖 4 个模型 (GPT-2 124M, SmolLM 135M/360M/1.7B)、10 代递归训练、6 种解码策略。\\\\n    结果 PPL 降低 0.85%–25.65%，diversity 提升 3.44%–14.62%。\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"验证 detect-and-reweight 有效防止 model collapse 且优于纯人类数据训练；b 值对模型规模敏感（小模型 b=10，大模型 b=1）\\\\\\\"\\\\n  differentiation:\\\\n    b_selection: \\\\\\\"Drayson: 验证集 empirical grid search, per-model 固定 | 我们: α_eff(b) + ESS 约束, per-batch 自适应\\\\\\\"\\\\n    contamination_setting: \\\\\\\"Drayson: 不假设已知比例（原文明确声明），但实验为控制设置 | 我们: 未知比例（batch 统计量在线估计）\\\\\\\"\\\\n    detector: \\\\\\\"Drayson: ModernBERT 150M (AUC=0.986) | 我们: TF-IDF+LR (AUC=0.939)，证明轻量检测器即可\\\\\\\"\\\\n    theory: \\\\\\\"Drayson: 无 b 选取理论（SIR 启发式） | 我们: 收敛理论 motivated α_eff(b) 推导\\\\\\\"\\\\n    training_scenario: \\\\\\\"Drayson: 递归训练 model collapse prevention | 我们: Web corpus 一次性预训练中的未知污染\\\\\\\"\\\\n    scale: \\\\\\\"Drayson: WikiText-2 (~2M tokens) | 我们: FineWeb subset (132M+ tokens)\\\\\\\"\\\\n    dynamics: \\\\\\\"Drayson: b 固定（训练全程不变） | 我们: b* per-batch 自适应\\\\\\\"\\\\n  our_advantages:\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"From heuristic to principled: 理论推导 b* 替代 empirical grid search，零额外 validation cost\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"Zero validation cost: 无需 validation set 做 b 选择，适用大规模 web pretraining（Drayson 也不假设已知比例，但其 b 选择依赖 validation set）\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"Lightweight detector sufficiency: TF-IDF+LR 即可，检测器计算开销降低数量级\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"Unified continuous spectrum: b=0 uniform → b→∞ hard filter 的统一框架\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"最直接的竞争者。共享 w=(1-q)^b 公式，但 b 选取方法根本不同——我们的核心贡献正是理论推导 adaptive b*\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: he_2025_golden_ratio\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Golden Ratio Weighting Prevents Model Collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Hengzhi He, Shirong Xu, Guang Cheng\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"Under review at JRSSB, 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2502.18049\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.18049\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"从理论推导合成/真实数据混合的最优权重，发现最优权重为黄金比例的倒数(~0.62)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"在高斯估计、GLM、非参数估计等场景下，当合成数据与真实数据等量时，真实数据的最优权重约为 0.62（黄金比例倒数）。公式 w*=(√(k²+4k)−k)/2, k=真实/合成样本比\\\\\\\"\\\\n  differentiation:\\\\n    scope: \\\\\\\"纯理论工作，假设已知污染比例，未涉及检测器或 LLM 实验，不处理 unknown/online 设置\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"同样是理论推导最优权重，但针对 real/synthetic 固定混合比例，未考虑检测器置信度的连续估计\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: feng_2025_beyond_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Beyond Model Collapse: Scaling Up with Synthesized Data Requires Verification\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Yunzhen Feng, Elvis Dohmatob, Pu Yang, François Charton, Julia Kempe\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.07515\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"使用 verifier 过滤合成数据防止 model collapse，理论证明即使不完美的 verifier 也有效\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"用高斯混合模型和线性分类器推导条件，证明 verifier 引导的合成数据筛选可避免 model collapse；即使 verifier 不完美也能受益\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"与我们的方法最相似——都用检测器置信度来处理合成数据。区别在于他们做 hard filtering，我们做 soft reweighting\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# Category: theoretical-foundation\\\\n# 理论动机来源\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- id: wang_2026_survive_contamination\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Can Generative Artificial Intelligence Survive Data Contamination? Theoretical Guarantees under Contaminated Recursive Training\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Kevin Wang, Hongqian Niu, Didong Li\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2602.16065\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.16065\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: theoretical-foundation\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"τ（α_eff 质量下界阈值）的理论动机来源；在通用框架下证明污染递归训练仍然收敛\\\\\\\"\\\\n  method_summary: >\\\\n    在最小假设（不限数据分布、允许通用逼近器生成模型）下研究递归训练。\\\\n    证明收敛率 = min(基线模型收敛率, α)，其中 α = m₁/(m₁+m₂) 是每轮真实数据比例。\\\\n    首个不依赖分布假设的递归训练正面理论结果。进一步扩展到采样偏差场景。\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"收敛率由真实数据比例 α 下界控制；α 越大收敛越快；即使有污染，只要 α > 0 训练仍收敛\\\\\\\"\\\\n  tension_with_our_work: >\\\\n    论文中 α = m₁/(m₁+m₂) 是**已知设计参数**（依赖已知的真实/合成数据比例），\\\\n    而我们的 τ 是 empirical hyperparameter（通过检测器统计量在线估计）。\\\\n    与 Claim 3（proportion-free）存在张力：Wang 的理论要求知道 α，\\\\n    我们的方法不假设已知比例，而是通过 α_eff(b) 间接逼近。\\\\n    需在论文中明确讨论：我们的 τ 是 α 的 principled proxy，而非精确值。\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"为 α_eff 阈值提供理论合理性——收敛保证依赖真实数据有效比例，我们的 b* 选取正是为了保证 α_eff(b) ≥ τ\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# Category: method-component\\\\n# 我们用到的技术组件\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- id: kimura_2024_iw_survey\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Short Survey on Importance Weighting for Machine Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Masanari Kimura, Hideitsu Hino\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"TMLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.10175\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"importance weighting 在机器学习中的全面综述，覆盖分布偏移、密度比估计等核心理论\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"系统整理了 importance weighting 在监督学习分布偏移下的理论保证和应用，包括 covariate shift、domain adaptation 等场景\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"为我们的 importance weighting 框架提供理论基础和方法论参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: vehtari_2024_psis\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Pareto Smoothed Importance Sampling\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Aki Vehtari, Daniel Simpson, Andrew Gelman, Yuling Yao, Jonah Gabry\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"JMLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1507.02646\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"提供稳定的 effective sample size 估计和收敛诊断方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"用广义 Pareto 分布拟合 importance ratio 上尾实现平滑；提出 Pareto k 有限样本收敛率诊断指标；k<min(1-1/log10(S),0.7) 时估计可靠\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"我们的 α_eff(b) 估计直接依赖 effective sample size 理论，PSIS 的收敛诊断可用于验证我们的权重方案\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: sow_2025_dynamic_reweighting\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Dynamic Loss-Based Sample Reweighting for Improved Large Language Model Pretraining\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Daouda Sow, Herbert Woisetschläger, Saikiran Bulusu, Shiqiang Wang, Hans-Arno Jacobsen, Yingbin Liang\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.06733\\\\\\\"\\\\n  github: \\\\\\\"https://github.com/sowmaster/Sample-Level-Loss-Reweighting-ICLR-2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"首次提出 loss-based reweighting 对梯度优化收敛性影响的理论框架\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"基于 loss 值动态调整每个样本权重；建立了 loss-based reweighting 对收敛界影响的形式化刻画；在 7B 和 1.4B 模型上验证更快收敛和更优性能\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"其收敛性理论框架可作为我们推导 b* 最优性的参考；loss-based 与 provenance-based reweighting 互补（不使用检测器，纯 loss signal 驱动）\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: ye_2025_data_mixing_laws\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Data Mixing Laws: Optimizing Data Mixtures by Predicting Language Modeling Performance\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Jiasheng Ye, Peiju Liu, Tianxiang Sun, Yunhua Zhou, Jun Zhan, Xipeng Qiu\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.16952\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"发现数据混合比例与模型性能之间的定量可预测性\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"模型性能关于混合比例具有函数形式的可预测性；可用小规模训练预测大模型在不同混合下的性能；适用于 continual training 的遗忘预测\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"data mixing laws 可作为验证我们 b* 最优性的理论框架——检验不同 b 下的 mixing 效果是否符合预测\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: he_2024_softdedup\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"SoftDedup: an Efficient Data Reweighting Method for Speeding Up Language Model Pre-training\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Nan He, Weichen Xiong, Hanwen Liu, Yi Liao, Lei Ding, Kai Zhang, Guohua Tang, Xiao Han, Yang Wei\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.06654\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"用 data commonness 指标进行软去重加权，而非硬删除\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"用 n-gram 模型量化样本的 commonness，高频样本降权低频样本升权；相比硬去重保留信息完整性；等效训练时间提升 26% 效率和 1.77% 下游准确率\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"软加权优于硬过滤的思路与我们一致——w=(1-q)^b 是连续加权而非二元过滤\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: xie_2023_doremi\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"DoReMi: Optimizing Data Mixtures Speeds Up Language Model Pretraining\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Sang Michael Xie, Hieu Pham, Xuanyi Dong, Nan Du, Hanxiao Liu, Yifeng Lu, Percy Liang, Quoc V. Le, Tengyu Ma, Adams Wei Yu\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10429\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"域级别权重优化（Group DRO + 小模型代理），不处理 instance-level 污染\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"用小代理模型通过 Group DRO 优化域级别数据混合权重；在 The Pile 和 GLaM 数据集上无需目标分布知识即可改善下游性能\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"域级别 reweighting baseline；我们的方法在 instance-level 操作，粒度更细且基于检测器置信度而非 loss-based DRO\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: xie_2023_dsir\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Data Selection for Language Models via Importance Resampling\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Sang Michael Xie, Shibani Santurkar, Tengyu Ma, Percy Liang\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.03169\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"N-gram 特征重要性采样选择数据子集匹配目标分布\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"用 n-gram 特征估计 importance weights 并重采样数据匹配目标分布；比 heuristic filtering 更 principled；在 GLUE 和下游任务上优于随机选择和启发式方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"同样用 importance resampling，但目标是分布匹配而非污染处理；与 Drayson 的 SIR 方法有方法论联系\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: chen_2025_aioli\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Aioli: A Unified Optimization Framework for Language Model Data Mixing\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Mayee F. Chen, Michael Y. Hu, Nicholas Lourie, Kyunghyun Cho, Christopher Ré\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2411.05735\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.05735\\\\\\\"\\\\n  github: \\\\\\\"https://github.com/HazyResearch/aioli\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"在线自适应数据混合优化框架，统一现有 domain-level mixing 方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"统一 DoReMi/Data Mixing Laws 等为标准优化问题（最小化平均 loss + mixing law 约束）；提出 AIOLI 在训练中动态估计 mixing law 参数并调整比例；6/6 数据集上超越分层采样\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"最直接的 non-grid-search adaptive weighting 对比：AIOLI 是 domain-level 在线优化，我们是 instance-level α_eff-based 在线优化。AIOLI 不处理污染，纯 loss-driven\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: yang_2026_data_mixing_agent\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Data Mixing Agent: Learning to Re-weight Domains for Continual Pre-training\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Kailai Yang, Xiao Liu, Lei Ji, Hao Li, Xiao Liang, Zhiwei Liu, Yeyun Gong, Peng Cheng, Mao Yang\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2507.15640\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.15640\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"用 RL 学习 domain 级别数据混合权重，解决 continual pretraining 中的灾难性遗忘\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"首个 model-based end-to-end 域权重学习框架；RL agent 在大量 mixing trajectory 上学习泛化启发式；跨 source field、target model、domain space 泛化\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"另一条 non-grid-search 路线（RL-based），但在 domain-level 操作且不处理污染检测；我们的 b* 推导更轻量（无需 RL 训练）\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# Category: background\\\\n# 数据污染/合成数据在 LLM 训练中的问题\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- id: shumailov_2024_model_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"AI Models Collapse When Trained on Recursively Generated Data\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Ilia Shumailov, Zakhar Shumaylov, Yiren Zhao, Nicolas Papernot, Ross Anderson, Yarin Gal\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"Nature 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-07566-y\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"奠基性工作——证明在递归生成数据上训练导致 model collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"在 LLM、VAE、GMM 上证明不加区分地用模型生成内容训练会导致不可逆退化；原始分布的尾部逐渐消失；反复训练的语言模型出现重复短语\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"model collapse 是我们工作的核心动机——加权方案的目标就是防止污染数据导致的性能退化\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: alemohammad_2024_mad\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Self-Consuming Generative Models Go MAD\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Sina Alemohammad, Josue Casco-Rodriguez, Lorenzo Luzi, Ahmed Imtiaz Humayun, Hossein Babaei, Daniel LeJeune, Ali Siahkoohi, Richard G. Baraniuk\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.01850\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"提出 Model Autophagy Disorder (MAD) 概念——自消费式生成模型的退化\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"分析三种自消费循环（fully synthetic、synthetic augmentation、fresh data）；无新鲜真实数据时质量或多样性不可避免下降；即使保留原始训练数据也可能退化\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"MAD 的数学框架帮助理解不同污染程度下的退化动力学，为我们的收敛理论提供上下文\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: dohmatob_2025_strong_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Strong Model Collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Elvis Dohmatob, Yunzhen Feng, Arjun Subramonian, Julia Kempe\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025 (Spotlight)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2410.04840\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.04840\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"证明即使极少量合成数据（1/1000）也能导致 model collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"在 scaling laws 框架下建立 strong model collapse；用算子值自由概率论获得测试误差的 bias-variance 分解；更大模型可放大 collapse 效应\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"强化了我们工作的必要性——即使少量合成污染也需要处理，仅靠增加数据量无法解决\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: nait_saada_2025_quality_illusion\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Data-Quality Illusion: Rethinking Classifier-Based Quality Filtering for LLM Pretraining\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Thiziri Nait Saada, Louis Bethune, Michal Klein, David Grangier, Marco Cuturi, Pierre Ablin\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.00866\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"质疑基于分类器的数据质量评分是否真正捕获了有意义的质量概念\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"CQF 改善下游任务但不一定改善语言建模；质量分类器隐式偏向其监督目标的数据分布；质量桶与特定 benchmark 对齐\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"提醒我们检测器置信度 q 不等于真实质量——需要理论保证 b* 在检测器有偏时仍然有效\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: guo_2025_escaping_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Escaping Model Collapse via Synthetic Data Verification\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2510.16657\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.16657\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"提出验证机制筛选合成数据质量，与 detection-based 方法互补\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"通过验证机制在合成数据生成后筛选质量，与基于检测器的事后加权方法互补\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"verification-based 方法是另一条技术路线——他们做生成时验证，我们做训练时加权\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: cheng_2025_contamination_survey\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Survey on Data Contamination for Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Yuxing Cheng, Yi Chang, Yuan Wu\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2502.14425\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14425\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"数据污染问题的全面综述，覆盖检测方法和 contamination-free 评估策略\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"系统整理训练/测试数据重叠的检测方法（MIA-based、reference-based、data updating/rewriting）；分析 contamination 对 benchmark 可靠性的影响；提出三类 contamination-free 评估策略\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"为我们的 problem statement 提供全面综述支撑——pretraining data contamination 是 LLM 社区公认的系统性问题\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: wei_2024_data_watermarks\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Proving Membership in LLM Pretraining Data via Data Watermarks\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Johnny Tian-Zheng Wei, Ryan Yixiang Wang, Robin Jia\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  arxiv_id: \\\\\\\"2402.10892\\\\\\\"\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.10892\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"用数据水印证明数据集是否在 LLM 预训练中被使用，数据溯源的主动方案\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"在公开发布前嵌入随机水印，检测建模为假设检验（控制误检率）；两种水印：随机序列插入和 Unicode lookalike 替换；水印强度随数据集增大而减弱但随模型增大而保持\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"主动 provenance 方案（事前水印）vs 我们的被动方案（事后检测+加权）；互补但不冲突\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# Category: evaluation\\\\n# 评估方法相关\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- id: mitchell_2023_detectgpt\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"DetectGPT: Zero-Shot Machine-Generated Text Detection using Probability Curvature\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Eric Mitchell, Yoonho Lee, Alexander Khazatsky, Christopher D. Manning, Chelsea Finn\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.11305\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: evaluation\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"零样本机器生成文本检测方法——我们的检测器 q 的基线方法之一\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"LLM 生成的文本倾向于占据模型对数概率函数的负曲率区域；无需训练分类器、收集数据集或水印；在 GPT-NeoX 假新闻检测上从 0.81 AUROC 提升到 0.95\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"可作为计算合成概率 q 的检测器之一；其概率曲率方法可能与我们的权重公式有理论联系\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: shi_2024_minkprob\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Detecting Pretraining Data from Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Weijia Shi, Anirudh Ajith, Mengzhou Xia, Yangsibo Huang, Daogao Liu, Terra Blevins, Danqi Chen, Luke Zettlemoyer\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.16789\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: evaluation\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"Min-K% Prob 方法——检测数据是否在预训练集中的无参考方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"已训练数据包含更少低概率异常 token；取最低 K% token 概率的平均值判断；在 WikiMIA 上比最佳基线高 7.4 AUC；无需参考模型\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"Min-K% Prob 可作为估计合成概率 q 的候选方法；其 membership inference 思路可扩展为连续置信度估计\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: kuo_2024_data_weighting\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Not All LLM-Generated Data Are Equal: Rethinking Data Weighting in Text Classification\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Hsun-Yu Kuo et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21526\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: evaluation\\\\n  role: \\\\\\\"评估合成数据加权策略在文本分类中的效果\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_findings: \\\\\\\"提出加权损失方法用少量真实数据对齐合成数据分布；在 BERT 级模型上稳定优于标准交叉熵和其他加权方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n  relevance_to_us: \\\\\\\"验证了合成数据需要差异化加权的思路；其评估框架可参考用于我们的下游任务评估\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 15632, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9ZUppDSzV44rVjzo6CkqD","session_id":"4e76514d-f28c-4641-af3a-08051cc17412","uuid":"b4a7cc7f-a976-469c-a8ea-edc7958921d1","timestamp":"2026-05-15T11:14:54.806Z"}
