ractical study。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: D021 应对：优先级重排 + experiment_plan 补充 τ/GR/batchsize 实验 + paper reframing\\\\n    启动\\\\n  rationale: 'D021 确认 α_eff 退化为 ESS 阈值化 + τ 依赖 contamination_ratio。响应：(1) τ 代码修复为\\\\n    #1 优先级（不需 GPU）; (2) paper_framing 需从 \\\\\\\"theoretical framework\\\\\\\" 转向 \\\\\\\"practical heuristic\\\\\\\";\\\\n    (3) experiment_plan 补充 p0_tau_fix_validation, p0_tau_sweep, p0_golden_ratio_baseline,\\\\n    p0_batchsize_8, p0_batchsize_16; (4) P0 总量升至 ~103h 超预算，需在 P0 内按优先级取舍; (5) Agent\\\\n    queue 合并为单条综合指令。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: τ=0.8 in current runs\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260515T011902\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: all three tiers Weak Reject\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: 修正 D021/D022 过度修正 — α_eff 非 decorative，dual-constraint 框架恢复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Q1 分析 + Reviewer 独立核实：(1) α_eff(b) 单调性成立但优化方向是 inf{b: α_eff≥τ}（最小干预）而非\\\\n    max α_eff → α_eff 是 b 的下界约束而非被推到 ESS 边界; (2) 实证：~40% reweighted batch 中 α_eff\\\\n    binding (b*=1.67 vs ESS-only 4.15); (3) D021 \\\\\\\"α_eff decorative\\\\\\\" 判断错误——正确表述：α_eff\\\\n    和 ESS 是双重约束，α_eff 提供质量下界（至少清洁到 τ），ESS 提供稳定上界（最多清洁到 n_min）; (4) 需 ESS-only baseline\\\\n    实验证明 min-intervention 优于 max-intervention。τ 依赖 contamination_ratio 问题不变，仍需修复。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 40.1% α_eff binding in reweighted batches, b*=1.67 vs ESS-only 4.15\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: GPU 预算决策 — Llama-3B 降级 P1，P0 聚焦核心消融；强化 ESS-only 备选方案'\\\\n  rationale: P0 需 ~107h，剩余 ~85h，缺口 22h。Llama-3B 占 ~25h 且非核心论证必需（单模型论文在 EMNLP 可接受）。去掉后\\\\n    P0≈82h < 85h，预算可行。EMNLP ARR May 25 仅剩 10 天，需聚焦 dual-constraint story 核心消融（τ fix,\\\\n    ESS-only baseline, Golden Ratio, n_min, batch_size, τ sweep）。Llama-3B 保留为 P1，有余力再做。ESS-only\\\\n    baseline 备选方案从\\\\\\\"min-intervention 更保守\\\\\\\"强化为\\\\\\\"reframe as empirical study if ESS-only\\\\n    ≈ dual\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: τ 理论来源确认依赖已知比例 — 降级为 empirical hyperparameter with theoretical motivation'\\\\n  rationale: arXiv 2602.16065 审计确认：α := m₁/(m₁+m₂) 是已知设计参数，收敛 bound 推导前提是 α 已知。τ 不能声称有\\\\n    proportion-free 的理论推导。采用方案 A：τ 定位为 empirical hyperparameter，收敛理论仅作为\\\\\\\"为什么需要质量阈值\\\\\\\"的\\\\n    motivation。Claim 3 \\\\\\\"unknown proportion\\\\\\\" 仍成立（b* 推导不需要已知比例，ESS 和 α_eff 都从 batch\\\\n    统计量计算），但 τ 的特定值需要 empirical justification（τ sweep 提供）。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D026: Checkpoint resume artifact — seed456 b=2.0/3.0/5.0 不重跑，论文用 2 seeds'\\\\n  rationale: grid_b2_0_seed456 从 checkpoint-3500 恢复后 eval_ppl=17.989，偏离预期 0.264（正常跨\\\\n    seed 变异 ~0.01，15 倍）。LR/optimizer state 恢复异常是最可能原因。grid_b3_0/b5_0 同样从 checkpoint\\\\n    恢复，预计有相同问题。决定不重跑：(1) grid sweep 主结论（b=0.5 最优、PPL 单调递增）从 seed42+seed123 已充分建立；(2)\\\\n    GPU 预算紧张，优先给 ESS-only/golden ratio/nmin/τ sweep；(3) 论文 Table 1 中 b≥2.0 报告 2 seeds\\\\n    并标注。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grid_b2_0_seed456\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: checkpoint resume artifact, PPL=17.989 vs expected ~17.733\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: grid_b_low 降优先级，τ sweep 提前；cuda:2→nmin1, cuda:3→golden_ratio'\\\\n  rationale: grid_b_low 两次被 cron 误杀（infrastructure bug），checkpoint 全部丢失。b<0.5 区间对核心\\\\n    claim 不关键（grid sweep 主结论已从 b=0.5-5.0 建立）。GPU 预算紧张，τ sweep（D025 后成为 Claim 3 唯一直接实证支撑）优先级高于\\\\n    grid_b_low。当前分配：cuda:1=ess_only, cuda:2=nmin1, cuda:3=golden_ratio, cuda:0=τ sweep\\\\n    first（eval完成后）。\\\